<h3>Supported keys and user actions</h3>

<div class="kd-text kd-text-secondary">
    <h3>Overview</h3>
    <p>
        The Filter is a single tab stop component implementing the roving tab index pattern.
    </p>
    <p>
        The entire Filter is a single tab stop component. Navigation among items is available using Up Arrow and Down Arrow.
        Internal ToolBar navigation can be activated upon pressing Enter on a treeitem. Navigation returns back to the tree when pressing Esc.
    </p>
    <h3>Filter Groups and Filter Expressions</h3>
    <p>
        FilterGroup and FilterExpression elements implement the KB navigation specification for the ToolBar component. You can refer
        to <a href="https://demos.telerik.com/blazor-ui/toolbar/keyboard-navigation" target="_blank">ToolBar - Keyboard Navigation</a>
        for its supported shortcuts.
    </p>
</div>

<h3>Tree</h3>
<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Up Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Focuses the first focusable element inside a FilterGroup or FilterExpression <strong>UP</strong> the tree.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Down Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Focuses the first focusable element inside a FilterGroup or FilterExpression <strong>DOWN</strong> the tree.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Left Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Focuses the previous focusable element inside the FilterGroup or FilterExpression.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Right Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Focuses the next focusable element inside the FilterGroup or FilterExpression.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Enter</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Enters inner navigation of the focused FilterGroup or FilterExpression item.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Esc</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Exits inner navigation of the focused FilterGroup or FilterExpression item.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>
